    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "享介さん、番組収録お疲れ様でした。\nトークがすごく盛り上がりましたね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "presence": "not-applicable",
        "reason": "non-idol-dialogue",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 5
      },
      "diagnostics": [],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_013kys_1_5_013_01:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "トークテーマが『驚いた家族の行動』だったからね。\nとっておきの悠介の話があってよかったよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "013kys"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "013kys",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 6
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_013kys_1_5_013_01:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "自分で見るって言ってホラー映画を見たのに\n廊下の電気をつけないと部屋に戻れなくってさ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "013kys"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "013kys",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_013kys_1_5_013_01:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": null,
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "部屋も暗いと怖くて眠れないって言ってたのに、\n結局、頭から布団かぶって寝てるんだよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "013kys"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "013kys",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 8
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_5_013kys_1_5_013_01:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
